comment.narrative:
Target 1088 actual 81,68 because of the coast of the remaining supplies to be purchased. 

The supplies have already been purchased and delivered to PFSCE. These included flip charts, glue sticks, erasers, notebook covers, pens, notebooks, photocopy paper, file folders, white glue, post-its, badge holders, badge lanyards, school slates, pencils, and colored pencils. These supplies are intended for setting up a children's space where they can have time to play and interact with one another.
More supplies will be purchased in the coming months.;
